  "originalText": "[Code Name] Chestnut\n[Gender] Male\n[Combat Experience] None\n[Place of Birth] Undisclosed\n[Date of Birth] Mar 15\n[Race] Durin\n[Height] 132cm\n[Infection Status]\nMedical tests have confirmed that no infection is present.",
